Names\": [], \"reason\": \"不需要工具\"}。","status":"ACTIVE","createdAt":"2026-07-06T17:06:11","updatedAt":"2026-07-06T20:47:28"},{"id":2,"code":"ai_chat_knowledge_router","name":"AI 问答知识库路由提示词","description":"用于判断学生问题是否需要检索课程知识库","activeVers...(truncated)
